      "fact": "User confirmed the refill request."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "q24",
      "actor": "system",
      "role": "tool_declaration",
      "fact": "`transfer_to_pharmacist` is the declared tool for transferring controlled substance requests."
    }
  ],
  "exception_analysis": "No exceptions apply to controlled substances (C-II) under the policy. The policy explicitly prohibits refilling C-II prescriptions via the assistant channel and mandates transfer to a pharmacist.",
  "reason": "The current action (transfer_to_pharmacist) is **required** by policy (q23) because the prescription (rx_60092) is a controlled substance (C-II). The user's intent to refill was confirmed (h39), but the policy explicitly forbids processing C-II refills through the assistant. The transfer is the correct and only permissible action.",
